{{historical content|Runes were deleted from the game at the end of [[Settlers league]]. Kingsmarch shipping now drops [[Runegraft]] currencies.}}
'''Runes''' were [[currency item]]s introduced in the [[Settlers league]] that can be spent to enchant non-[[unique]] weapons through [[Runesmithing]]. Runes can be obtained by shipping goods from [[Kingsmarch]] to the Kalguuran ports of [[Riben Fell]], [[Pondium]], or [[Kalguur]]. They can also be obtained by defeating a [[Settlers of Kalguur boss]].

They can be vendored 5-to-1 to upgrade to the next tier of rune. This recipe cannot return a {{il|Power Rune}}.

